    "text": "stlpr.org\nwebsite\nSt Louis County, Missouri\nSt. Louis County steps up efforts for senior property tax freeze\nBy St. Louis Public Radio,21 hours ago\nSt. Louis County officials are encouraging seniors to apply for a property tax freeze before the end of the month. The program freezes property taxes for eligible senior owners, which under state law is anyone who is 62 or older as of Dec. 31, 2024. The deadline to sign up is June 30.\n4\nComments\nLoading editor...",
